## PowerShell Notes (Windows)

This project runs on Windows with PowerShell. Key differences from bash:

| What | PowerShell | Bash (DON'T use) |
|------|-----------|-----------------|
| Run in conda env | `conda run -n trader --no-capture-output <cmd>` | `conda activate trader && <cmd>` |
| Chain commands | `cmd1; if ($?) { cmd2 }` | `cmd1 && cmd2` |
| Set env var | `$env:VAR='val'; cmd` | `VAR=val cmd` |

**Always use `conda run -n trader --no-capture-output`** to run scripts. Do NOT use `conda activate trader && ...` -- PowerShell does not support `&&`.


# Generate data for set_07
